{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkSuspiciousFilesWithTiming","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"path","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"suspiciousJailbreakHookTimingInSeconds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/SuspiciousFilesWithTimingResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:20iOSJailbreakDetector31SuspiciousFilesWithTimingResultO","text":"SuspiciousFilesWithTimingResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"path","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The path of the file you want to check (e.g., "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\/Applications\/Cydia.app\""},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\/usr\/bin\/ssh\""},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"name":"suspiciousJailbreakHookTimingInSeconds","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Time (in seconds) threshold for considering a runtime hooking."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/documentation\/iOSJailbreakDetector\/SuspiciousFilesWithTimingResult"},{"type":"text","text":" indicating the detection status:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineConte